\title{Codimension-two points}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{A codimension-one bifurcation degenerates at a point of a
two-parameter plane. There the bifurcation from rest to
spiking can change.}

\p{Where does the Hopf curve change criticality, and where does
it meet a fold?}

